The legal texts come from the Basiswettenbestand (BWB) of the Kingdom of the Netherlands:

  Wet- en regelgeving: Basiswettenbestand (https://wetten.overheid.nl), KOOP (Kennis- en Exploitatiecentrum
  Officiele Overheidspublicaties), Ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties, retrieved 28 October 2026.
  Staatsblad metadata: https://zoek.officielebekendmakingen.nl, retrieved 28 October 2026.

KOOP publishes the BWB and officielebekendmakingen.nl as open data under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal public
domain dedication. Dutch statutes, decrees and regulations are moreover not protected by copyright (Auteurswet,
art. 11).

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph, member or list
item per line; spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; footnotes and metadata were removed; and the versions were
arranged as git commits credited to the Staatsblad publications the BWB names for each change. The wording of the law
was not changed. KOOP does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:

CC0 1.0 Universal

The person who associated a work with this deed has dedicated the work to the public domain by waiving all of his or
her rights to the work worldwide under copyright law, including all related and neighboring rights, to the extent
allowed by law.

You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
